    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀβλεμής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλεμεαίνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>feeble,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				82
			</span></i>; in Lit. Crit. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πρᾶγμα</span>]
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀβλεμὲς προσπίπτει</span> falls
				<i>flat,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				29.1
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀβλεμέως, πίνων</span> drinking
				<i>intemperately,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Panyas.
				13.8
			</span></i>.</div>
